{"message":"Based on the currently available offers, the best personal-card option is the EcoCard. You can earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit—after spending $5,000 on eligible purchases within your first month. The offer is available through December 15, 2025, and requires new-customer status.

If you’re considering business cards, the Business Bronze Rewards Card has a larger fixed offer: a $500 statement credit after $10,000 in net purchases within the first two months. The Silver Rewards Card’s $500 offer is no longer available; its offer ended June 30, 2025.

So: choose the EcoCard for a personal card, or the Business Bronze Rewards Card if you’re eligible for a business card and can meet the higher spending requirement."}
